{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/a48491ab7e4790c2b87e7d53b9f3b185.poster.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/a48491ab7e4790c2b87e7d53b9f3b185.webm?t=1759872214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/a48491ab7e4790c2b87e7d53b9f3b185.mp4?t=1759872214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's the end of days for this fringe terraforming colony... and you're the damage control. Play as Noah Gansky, a resourceful combat engineer armed only with his wits, his agility, and his Omniaxe. Fight your way through hordes of alien bugs, energy cultists, and professional super-soldiers as you try to save the people of Ross 128-b and escape the grasp of the Solar Dominion.<br><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/e21aa3c57ee18abe1760ed9e2192521c.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=71 /></span><br><br>Jump, slide and dash your way to mastering your environment. Explore a deep world strewn with secrets, and survive the cataclysm of Ross-128b!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/32a5fcc54a82f82fb2e040d794af52ec.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=71 /></span><br><br>Outmaneuver your enemies, using the environment to your advantage. Unlock key upgrades for your arsenal, giving you more ways to exploit the enemy's weakness. Sustain your arsenal with fuel harvested from enemies with The Omniaxe!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/306a8fb68d23f17ee52f96973630e0b3.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=71 /></span><br><br>Return to conquered areas with new tools, and reveal hidden challenges! Your weapons and abilities can also interact with the environment. Hit an electrical breaker box with an electric dart to restore power to an area, blast your way through hard alien goop with a charge shot, and break through walls with a dash attack!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/3ab40e0d608fbb811ae417b749f6a3da.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=71 /></span><br><br>Your enemies, weapons and environment are brought to life with unique hand-drawn sprite work. Sprite animations are drawn frame-by-frame, and brimming with fluid and expressive movement.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1677900?t=1759872214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1677900?t=1759872214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759872214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759872214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, Gore, and Violence are commonly used in Relentless Frontier. People die, enemies that get shot bleed and occasionally explode. Authoritarian political implications, and some scenes of mass death may be shocking."},"demos":[{"appid":1731320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/167790