ols, and reveal hidden challenges! Your weapons and abilities can also interact with the environment. Hit an electrical breaker box with an electric dart to restore power to an area, blast your way through hard alien goop with a charge shot, and break through walls with a dash attack!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/extras/3ab40e0d608fbb811ae417b749f6a3da.avif?t=1759872214\" width=600 height=71 /></span><br><br>Your enemies, weapons and environment are brought to life with unique hand-drawn sprite work. Sprite animations are drawn frame-by-frame, and brimming with fluid and expressive movement.","developers":["Fission Ogre"],"dlc":[3236860],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677900/header.jpg?t=1759872214","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677900/1448634026/4605cd10f4e1592029b06d4fa4029cc790923c71/1757704119/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757706334","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677900/1448634026/4605cd10f4e1592029b06d4fa4029cc790923c71/1757704119/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757706334","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677900/1448634026/4605cd10f4e1592029b06d4fa4029cc790923c71/1757704119/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757706334","id":257196980,"name":"Lore n Vania Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c